      "Me, 20 Years from Now",
      "",
      "Recently, an essay written by a primary school student made a lot of people laugh to a cry.",
      "The subject for his essay is “Me, 20 Years from Now”.",
      "",
      "In the essay he writes: Today the weather was pretty good.",
      "Me and my wife brought along our cute child and travelled around the world.",
      "Suddenly, a dirty and smelly homeless old lady appeared on the road.",
      "I looked closer, and oh my!",
      "Unexpectedly it was my literature and language teacher from 20 years ago!",
      "",
      "A lot of people said: Little friend, how much do you dislike your literature and language teacher?",
      ""
